## B. Modifications made in this repository — GNU GPL v3

The changes made in this repository (see the list below) are licensed under the
**GNU General Public License, Version 3 (GPL-3.0)**. The full text of the
GPL-3.0 License is provided in [LICENSE-GPL3](LICENSE-GPL3).

- **Disable automatic model release in the background** (`useAutoRelease` default
  changed from `true` to `false`).
- **Android foreground-service keep-alive** for the local API listener: a native
  foreground service is started when the local API server starts listening and
  stopped on failure/stop, to keep the local API endpoint alive while the screen
  is on.

